%% Diagram G - GUI inference sequence (Streamlit)
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as app/streamlit_app.py
    participant NC as src/prediction.NewsClassifier
    participant PP as src/preprocessing
    participant DV as src/document_vectors
    participant MD as selected_model.joblib

    User->>UI: types Gujarati headline, clicks Predict
    UI->>UI: validate input (non-empty)
    UI->>NC: get_classifier() (st.cache_resource)
    Note over NC,MD: loaded once per session
    NC->>MD: load artifact (HistGradientBoosting + metadata)
    NC->>PP: preprocess(headline)
    PP-->>NC: cleaned tokens
    NC->>DV: mean_pool_tokens(tokens, skipgram model)
    DV-->>NC: 100-d vector (zero vector if all OOV)
    NC->>MD: model.predict_proba(vector)
    MD-->>NC: score per category
    NC-->>UI: (label, scores)
    UI->>User: result card + sorted score bars
